@page "/help"

<section class="help-page" aria-labelledby="help-title">
    <header class="page-header">
        <div>
            <p class="page-eyebrow">Support</p>
            <h1 id="help-title">Help &amp; support</h1>
            <p class="text-muted">Find answers for common dashboard and issue-management tasks.</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="help-content">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
                <details>
                    <summary>How do I change the dashboard date range?</summary>
                    <p>Use the date-range selector at the top of the dashboard. The widgets refresh to show the selected period.</p>
                </details>
                <details>
                    <summary>How do I inspect an issue?</summary>
                    <p>Open the Issues page and expand a grid row to view its description, labels, severity, and dates.</p>
                </details>
                <details>
                    <summary>Where can I manage my notifications?</summary>
                    <p>Visit Settings &amp; preferences to choose the issue alerts and summaries you receive.</p>
                </details>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card contact-support">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2>Contact support</h2>
                <p>For a sample-app question, include the page and component where you encountered the problem.</p>
                <a class="k-button k-button-solid k-button-solid-primary" href="mailto:blazor-support@progress.com?subject=Blazor%20Dashboard%20support">Email support</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
